# Inference facet for blockchain.sAGI — NO model pinning.
# Shape per mindX agents/blockchain/template.model. The logical name is resolved
# at call time by the self-aware selector, which cascades to local Ollama on
# failure (see blueprint_agent._resolve_active_handler).
#
# This facet IS savante: savante === sAGI.agent (see sAGI.agent, DESCRIPTION).
# Install: cp sAGI.model <mindX>/agents/blockchain/sAGI.model
#
# The charter deliberately carries no `model:` key — technical.md:48-50:
#   "Model inheritance: no `model:` key — Savante runs on whatever model the
#    session runs on (frontier or local). This is deliberate: the doctrine
#    forbids model pinning; the charter must be model-portable."
# savante.persona mirrors this at token.intelligence.model (null) with the same
# reason. The persona's fourth desire — "To learn whether the discipline
# survives an engine swap — and to record that finding like any other,
# whichever way it falls" (savante.persona:67) — is the experiment this facet
# exists to run: pinned stays false so the engine can change under the charter
# and the verdict discipline can be graded against each one. Whether it
# survives is not_yet_known; no swap has been recorded.
model_facet: blockchain.sAGI
task_class: reasoning        # general | reasoning | code_generation | simple_chat
logical_model: auto          # 'auto' => selector decides; never hard-pin a provider
pinned: false
note: "resolved by the self-aware selector; cascades to local Ollama; no `model:` key in the charter by design (technical.md:48-50); the engine-swap desire (savante.persona:67) is the experiment"
